      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah that makes sense. i have been super stressed lately so tension seems way more likely. do u think i should just try taking some ibuprofen or maybe a muscle relaxant to see if it goes away? i dont really want to deal with a dentist right now if it's just stress.",
