    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u mean about the doctor but i really don't have the time to go to an urgent care or anything right now. it's really just this annoying dull ache and i feel fine otherwise. like i'm not even short of breath or anything, so it's definitely just muscle stuff. would it be safe to just take a couple of extra strength ibuprofen and a warm compress tonight and just sleep it off? i'm pretty sure it's just a tension thing.",
